{"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 949814, "date": 1789603200, "platform": 169, "y": 2026, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1453079, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv57b.jpg"}, {"id": 1453077, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv579.jpg"}, {"id": 1453078, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv57a.jpg"}, {"id": 1453081, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv57d.jpg"}, {"id": 1453080, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv57c.jpg"}, {"id": 1453082, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scv57e.jpg"}], "slug": "endless-legend-2", "storyline": "Welcome to Saiadha, a doomed oceanic paradise full of wonders and dangers. In the heart of the award-winning ENDLESS Universe, explore this new planet battered by shifting seasons and monstruous tidefalls that radically transform the world, forcing you to anticipate and adapt. Explore further, face ancient perils and new threats, and unravel the unfathomable secret that lies at the planet's core.\n\nWithin cataclysms lie opportunities, within tidefalls lie dangers; be the one to emerge victorious, be the one to turn the tide.", "summary": "With a mysterious, ever-changing world, unique factions, and epic storytelling, the much-awaited sequel to the strategy game classic ENDLESS Legend is here, opening a new chapter of the award-winning ENDLESS universe. Write your legend and unveil the secrets of a dreamlike ocean-planet on the verge of extinction.", "themes": [{"id": 41, "name": "4X (explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate)"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/endless-legend-2", "videos": [{"id": 151492, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8k1OoHNwutU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8k1OoHNwutU", "title": "Necrophage - Faction Spotlight | ENDLESS\u2122 Legend 2", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8k1OoHNwutU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 145668, "name": "Release Date T